	<section_number>30-141</section_number>
	<catch_line>Annual report</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Auditor of Public Accounts shall make an annual report of the activities of his office to the Governor and the General Assembly.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 2-144; 1966, c. 677, § 2.1-172.1; 2001, c. 844.</history>
</law>
